				((HorizontalOrVerticalLayoutGroup)component3).childForceExpandHeight = false;
				_pactSupportTitleText = CreateLabel(_pactSupportPopup.transform, "PactSupport_Title", string.Empty, 15, (FontStyle)1);
				_pactSupportTitleText.alignment = (TextAnchor)4;
				((Graphic)_pactSupportTitleText).color = new Color(0.9f, 0.82f, 0.45f);
				_pactSupportBodyText = CreateLabel(_pactSupportPopup.transform, "PactSupport_Body", string.Empty, 12, (FontStyle)0);
				((Graphic)_pactSupportBodyText).color = new Color(0.95f, 0.9f, 0.82f);
				ConfigureWrappedPopupBodyText(_pactSupportBodyText, 92);
				GameObject obj = CreateHorizontalRow(_pactSupportPopup.transform, "PactSupport_Row");
				Button button = CreateButton(obj.transform, "PactSupport_Accept", "Accept", OnAcceptPactSupportPrompt);
				Button button2 = CreateButton(obj.transform, "PactSupport_Deny", "Decline", OnDeclinePactSupportPrompt);
				((Graphic)((Component)button).GetComponent<Image>()).color = new Color(0.22f, 0.46f, 0.24f, 0.95f);
				((Graphic)((Component)button2).GetComponent<Image>()).color = new Color(0.46f, 0.22f, 0.22f, 0.95f);
				RethemeMenuHierarchy(_pactSupportPopup);
				_pactSupportPopup.SetActive(false);
			}
			_activePactSupportPrompt = pactSupportPromptEvent;
			_pactSupportLastPromptDayByGang[bossGangId] = nowDay;
			RefreshPactSupportPromptText();
			_pactSupportPopup.SetActive(true);
			ForceDockPopupFarLeft(_pactSupportPopup);
			_pactSupportPopup.transform.SetAsLastSibling();
			VerificationLog("PepTalkPact", $"prompt-shown gang={bossGangId} boss={bossName} day={nowDay} title={pactSupportPromptEvent.Title}");
			return true;
		}

		private static void RefreshPactSupportPromptText()
		{
			if (_activePactSupportPrompt == null || (UnityEngine.Object)(object)_pactSupportTitleText == (UnityEngine.Object)null || (UnityEngine.Object)(object)_pactSupportBodyText == (UnityEngine.Object)null)
			{
				return;
			}
			_pactSupportTitleText.text = _activePactSupportPrompt.Title;
			_pactSupportBodyText.text = FormatPromptBody(_activePactSupportPrompt.BossName, _activePactSupportPrompt.Body, "A pact boss sent word.");
			Transform transform = _pactSupportPopup != null ? _pactSupportPopup.transform.Find("PactSupport_Row") : null;
			if (transform == null)
			{
				return;
			}
			Button componentInChildren = ((Component)transform.Find("PactSupport_Accept")).GetComponent<Button>();
			Button componentInChildren2 = ((Component)transform.Find("PactSupport_Deny")).GetComponent<Button>();
			Text componentInChildren3 = ((Component)componentInChildren).GetComponentInChildren<Text>();
			Text componentInChildren4 = ((Component)componentInChildren2).GetComponentInChildren<Text>();
			if ((UnityEngine.Object)(object)componentInChildren3 != (UnityEngine.Object)null)
			{
				componentInChildren3.text = _activePactSupportPrompt.AcceptLabel;
			}
			if ((UnityEngine.Object)(object)componentInChildren4 != (UnityEngine.Object)null)
			{
				componentInChildren4.text = _activePactSupportPrompt.DeclineLabel;
			}
		}

		private static void ClosePactSupportPrompt()
		{
			if ((UnityEngine.Object)(object)_pactSupportPopup != (UnityEngine.Object)null)
			{
				_pactSupportPopup.SetActive(false);
			}
			_activePactSupportPrompt = null;
			RefreshHandlerUI();
			RefreshMyPactInfo();
		}

		private static void OnAcceptPactSupportPrompt()
		{
			try
			{
				PactSupportPromptEvent pactSupportPromptEvent = _activePactSupportPrompt;
				PlayerInfo humanPlayer = G.GetHumanPlayer();
				PlayerInfo playerById = G.FindPlayerById(pactSupportPromptEvent?.BossGangId ?? -1);
				if (pactSupportPromptEvent == null || humanPlayer == null || playerById == null || pactSupportPromptEvent.Pact == null)
				{
					ClosePactSupportPrompt();
					return;
				}
				int cost = Math.Max(0, pactSupportPromptEvent.Cost);
				if (cost > 0 && !humanPlayer.finances.CanChangeMoneyOnSafehouse(new Price((Fixnum)(-cost))))
				{
					if ((UnityEngine.Object)(object)_pactSupportBodyText != (UnityEngine.Object)null)
					{
						_pactSupportBodyText.text = "You do not have enough cash on hand for that favor.";
					}
					return;
				}
				if (!TryConsumePactPepTalk(pactSupportPromptEvent.BossGangId, "quest-accept"))
				{
					if ((UnityEngine.Object)(object)_pactSupportBodyText != (UnityEngine.Object)null)
					{
						_pactSupportBodyText.text = "No pact pep talk is available for that boss right now.";
					}
					return;
				}
				if (cost > 0)
				{
					humanPlayer.finances.DoChangeMoneyOnSafehouse(new Price((Fixnum)(-cost)), (MoneyReason)1);
				}
				float bossHappiness = pactSupportPromptEvent.Pact.GetBossHappiness(pactSupportPromptEvent.BossGangId);
				pactSupportPromptEvent.Pact.SetBossHappiness(pactSupportPromptEvent.BossGangId, bossHappiness + pactSupportPromptEvent.HappinessDeltaOnAccept);
				if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(pactSupportPromptEvent.RelationBuffId))
				{
					AddMutualRelationshipBuff(humanPlayer, playerById, pactSupportPromptEvent.RelationBuffId, GetCrewPeepForPlayer(humanPlayer), GetCrewPeepForPlayer(playerById));
				}
				TryAwardCrewStreetCreditProgress(humanPlayer, GetCrewPeepForPlayer(humanPlayer), 0.04f, 0.06f, "pact-support-quest");
				LogGrapevine(pactSupportPromptEvent.AcceptTickerText);
				ClosePactSupportPrompt();
				RefreshMyPactInfo();
			}
			catch (Exception ex)
			{
				Debug.LogWarning("[GameplayTweaks] OnAcceptPactSupportPrompt failed: " + ex.Message);
				ClosePactSupportPrompt();
			}
		}

		private static void OnDeclinePactSupportPrompt()
		{
			try
			{
				PactSupportPromptEvent pactSupportPromptEvent = _activePactSupportPrompt;
				if (pactSupportPromptEvent?.Pact != null && pactSupportPromptEvent.BossGangId >= 0)
				{
					if (!TryConsumePactPepTalk(pactSupportPromptEvent.BossGangId, "quest-decline"))
					{
						if ((UnityEngine.Object)(object)_pactSupportBodyText != (UnityEngine.Object)null)
						{
							_pactSupportBodyText.text = "No pact pep talk is available for that boss right now.";
						}
						return;
					}
					float bossHappiness = pactSupportPromptEvent.Pact.GetBossHappiness(pactSupportPromptEvent.BossGangId);
					pactSupportPromptEvent.Pact.SetBossHappiness(pactSupportPromptEvent.BossGangId, bossHappiness + pactSupportPromptEvent.HappinessDeltaOnDecline);
					if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(pactSupportPromptEvent.DeclineTickerText))
					{
						LogGrapevine(pactSupportPromptEvent.DeclineTickerText);
					}
				}
			}
			catch (Exception ex)
			{
				Debug.LogWarning("[GameplayTweaks] OnDeclinePactSupportPrompt failed: " + ex.Message);
			}
			ClosePactSupportPrompt();
			RefreshMyPactInfo();
		}

		private static void OnPepTalkPactBoss(AlliancePact pact, int bossGangId, string bossName)
		{
			try
			{
				if (pact == null)
				{
					return;
				}
				int remaining = GetPactPepTalksRemaining(bossGangId);
				VerificationLog("PepTalkPact", $"click gang={bossGangId} boss={bossName} day={G.GetNow().days} remaining={remaining}");
				if (remaining <= 0)
				{
					VerificationLog("PepTalkPact", $"blocked gang={bossGangId} boss={bossName} reason=no-uses");
					return;
				}
				if (TryQueuePactSupportPrompt(pact, bossGangId, bossName, requireChance: false))
				{
					RefreshHandlerUI();
					return;
				}
				if (!TryConsumePactPepTalk(bossGangId, "fallback"))
				{
					RefreshMyPactInfo();
					return;
				}
				float before = pact.GetBossHappiness(bossGangId);
				float after = Mathf.Clamp01(before + 0.1f);
				pact.SetBossHappiness(bossGangId, after);
				VerificationLog("PepTalkPact", $"fallback gang={bossGangId} boss={bossName} moodBefore={before:0.000} moodAfter={after:0.000}");
				LogGrapevine($"PACT: Pep talk with {bossName} - mood {((int)(before * 100f))}% -> {((int)(after * 100f))}%");
				RefreshMyPactInfo();
			}
			catch (Exception ex)
			{
				Debug.LogWarning($"[GameplayTweaks] OnPepTalkPactBoss failed: {ex.Message}");
			}
		}

		private static void LocateGangHideout(PlayerInfo gangPlayer)
		{
			try
			{
				if (gangPlayer == null || gangPlayer.territory == null)
				{
					Debug.LogWarning("[GameplayTweaks] Cannot locate gang - null player or territory");
					return;
				}
				EntityID safehouse = gangPlayer.territory.Safehouse;
				if (safehouse.IsNotValid)
				{
					Debug.LogWarning("[GameplayTweaks] Gang has no safehouse");
					return;
				}
				Entity entity = EntityIDExtensions.FindEntity(safehouse);
				if (entity == null)
				{
					Debug.LogWarning("[GameplayTweaks] Could not find safehouse entity");
					return;
				}
				Type personInfoType = typeof(GameClock).Assembly.GetType("Game.UI.Session.PersonInfoUtil");
				if (personInfoType != null)
				{
					MethodInfo tweenMethod = personInfoType.GetMethod("TweenCameraToEntity",
						BindingFlags.Static | BindingFlags.Public,
						null, new Type[] { typeof(EntityID), typeof(bool) }, null);
					if (tweenMethod != null)
					{
						tweenMethod.Invoke(null, new object[] { safehouse, true });
						Debug.Log($"[GameplayTweaks] Camera tweened to gang hideout via PersonInfoUtil");
						return;
					}
					MethodInfo tweenMethod2 = personInfoType.GetMethod("TweenCameraToEntity",
						BindingFlags.Static | BindingFlags.Public,
						null, new Type[] { typeof(Entity), typeof(bool) }, null);
					if (tweenMethod2 != null)
					{
						tweenMethod2.Invoke(null, new object[] { entity, true });
						Debug.Log($"[GameplayTweaks] Camera tweened to gang hideout via PersonInfoUtil (Entity)");
						return;
					}
				}
				Type hudUtilType = typeof(GameClock).Assembly.GetType("Game.UI.Session.HUDUtil");
				if (hudUtilType != null)
				{
					MethodInfo gotoMethod = hudUtilType.GetMethod("GoTo", BindingFlags.Static | BindingFlags.Public);
					if (gotoMethod != null)
					{
						WorldPos pos = entity.data.board.worldpos;
						gotoMethod.Invoke(null, new object[] { pos, false, true });
						Debug.Log($"[GameplayTweaks] Camera moved to gang hideout via HUDUtil.GoTo");
						return;
					}
				}
				Debug.LogWarning("[GameplayTweaks] Could not find camera focus method - PersonInfoUtil and HUDUtil unavailable");
			}
			catch (Exception ex)
			{
				Debug.LogError($"[GameplayTweaks] LocateGangHideout failed: {ex.Message}");
			}
		}

		private static void OnGiveCashToGang(PlayerInfo gangPlayer, string gangName)
		{

			try
			{
				PlayerInfo humanPlayer = G.GetHumanPlayer();
				if (humanPlayer == null || gangPlayer == null)
				{
					return;
				}
				if (humanPlayer.finances == null)
				{
					Debug.LogWarning("[GameplayTweaks] Human player finances is null");
					return;
				}
				if (gangPlayer.finances == null)
				{
					Debug.LogWarning(("[GameplayTweaks] Gang " + gangName + " finances is null - trying safehouse inventory"));
					try
					{
						PlayerTerritory territory = gangPlayer.territory;
						if (territory == null)
						{
							return;
						}
						EntityID safehouse = territory.Safehouse;
						if (!safehouse.IsValid)
						{
							return;
						}
						InventoryModule inventory = ModulesUtil.GetInventory(EntityIDExtensions.FindEntity(safehouse));
						if (inventory != null)
						{
							int num = 500;
							if (!humanPlayer.finances.CanChangeMoneyOnSafehouse(new Price(-num)))
							{
								Debug.Log("[GameplayTweaks] Can't afford to give $500");
								return;
							}
							humanPlayer.finances.DoChangeMoneyOnSafehouse(new Price(-num), (MoneyReason)1);
							inventory.ForceAddResourcesRegardlessOfSpace(new Label("cash"), num);
							LogGrapevine($"PACT: Your outfit donated ${num} to {gangName}");
							RefreshMyPactInfo();
							Debug.Log($"[GameplayTweaks] Added ${num} to {gangName} safehouse inventory");
						}
						return;
					}
					catch (Exception arg)
					{
						Debug.LogError($"[GameplayTweaks] Safehouse fallback failed: {arg}");
						return;
					}
				}
				int num2 = 500;
				if (!humanPlayer.finances.CanChangeMoneyOnSafehouse(new Price(-num2)))
				{
					Debug.Log("[GameplayTweaks] Can't afford to give $500");
					return;
				}
				humanPlayer.finances.DoChangeMoneyOnSafehouse(new Price(-num2), (MoneyReason)1);
				try
				{
					gangPlayer.finances.DoChangeMoneyOnSafehouse(new Price(num2), (MoneyReason)1);
					Debug.Log($"[GameplayTweaks] Donated ${num2} to {gangName} via finances");
				}
				catch (Exception ex)
				{
					Debug.LogWarning($"[GameplayTweaks] DoChangeMoneyOnSafehouse failed for {gangName}: {ex.Message} - trying inventory fallback");
					try
					{
						EntityID gangSafehouse = gangPlayer.territory.Safehouse;
						Entity gangSafeEntity = EntityIDExtensions.FindEntity(gangSafehouse);
						if (gangSafeEntity != null)
						{
							InventoryModule gangInv = ModulesUtil.GetInventory(gangSafeEntity);
							if (gangInv != null)
							{
								gangInv.ForceAddResourcesRegardlessOfSpace(new Label("cash"), num2);
								Debug.Log($"[GameplayTweaks] Donated ${num2} to {gangName} via safehouse inventory");
							}
						}
					}
					catch
					{
						Debug.LogError($"[GameplayTweaks] All donate paths failed for {gangName}");
					}
				}
				LogGrapevine($"PACT: Your outfit donated ${num2} to {gangName}");
				RefreshMyPactInfo();
			}
			catch (Exception arg2)
			{
				Debug.LogError($"[GameplayTweaks] Give cash failed: {arg2}");
			}
		}

